  owner: Room 3
  task: 'The boss: an armored officer with a flashlight (its beam burns the vampire)
    and a heavy shotgun (slow, huge damage up close). Needs its own combat: stay
    out of the beam, get behind him, break the armor. When he falls: Level2Director.Instance.BossDefeated()
    (stops the clock, opens the iron gate). F11 fakes it for testing.'
  color: {r: 1, g: 0.2, b: 0.2, a: 1}
