  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ReadableNote
  title: Report H-7
  body: 'Serum H-7 works. The subject in cell 1 has stopped burning through blood:
    the hunger, the decay, the clock, all of it stops.


    Side effect: he is weak.
    No reserve, no tricks. He sleeps most of the day.


    Keep him sedated until
    the transfer. Do NOT feed him.'
